  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\n**Decoding symbols:**\n\n \n \n\n **Symbol**\n P\n Q\n R\n S\n T\n U\n V\n \n \n\n **Meaning**\n +\n -\n ×\n ÷\n =\n >\n \n\nSo checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) 4 R 12 S 3 T 2 R 8 ⇒ 4 × 12 ÷ 3 = 2 × 8\n\n⇒ 4 × __**12 **____**÷**____** 3**__ = __**2 **____**× 8**__\n\n⇒ __**4 × 4**__ = 16\n\n**⇒ 16 = 16 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) 4 R 12 S 3 T 2 S 8 ⇒ 4 × 12 ÷ 3 = 2 ÷ 8\n\n⇒ 4 × __**12 **____**÷**____** 3**__ = __**2 **____**÷ 8**__\n\n⇒ __**4 × 4**__ = 0.25\n\n⇒ 16 ≠ 0.25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 4 R 12 S 3 U 2 R 8 ⇒ 4 × 12 ÷ 3 > 2 × 8\n\n⇒ 4 × __**12 **____**÷**____** 3**__ > **__2 __****__× 8__**\n\n⇒ __**4 × 4**__ > 16\n\n⇒ 16 > 16 (LHS > RHS)\n\nOption 4) 4R 12 P 3 T 2 R 8 ⇒ 4 × 12 + 3 = 2 × 8\n\n⇒ __**4 ×**____** 12**__ + 3 = __**2 **____**× 8**__\n\n⇒ __**48 +**____** 3**__ = 16\n\n⇒ 51 ≠ 16 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
